Output ../img/pick.gif
Set Height 420
Source common.tape

Hide
Type "cd /demo/project && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "ts --files | tp"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "lib"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "clear"
Enter
Type 'wc -l "$(ts --files | tp)"'
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "main"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
